      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 1986 John Wiley & Sons, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Many authors have contributed expressions for obtaining analytical matrix elements for Morse oscillators. In this work, we discuss the advantages of using these expressions. At the same time, we propose a full numerical method to calculate these matrix elements and we compare, for the I2 system, the different results given by Gallas, Vasan, and Cross, and the variational method."
